packages/computer-use/src/softwaregen/{models,templates,audit,runtime,generation}.ts
adapt the corresponding upstream Python softwaregen modules to TypeScript/Zod.
Changes include explicit separate host permission grants, pinned registry/support
files, bounded async I/O, stricter path/command/header validation, cancellation,
secret redaction and mapping into the existing Pi/MCP approval/runtime contract.
Upstream code is Apache-2.0; the complete license accompanies this notice.
Upstream DATA_LICENSE describes the separate CC BY 4.0 data/documentation terms.

softwaregen-examples/ contains unchanged upstream example JSON files, not a new
application integration or a redistribution of benchmark/training datasets.
Regressions explicitly rebind the Python reference command to a pinned Node
fixture. No upstream Python runtime, agent loop or training code is bundled.
